  "description": "Parquet companion for ToolUp.Platform, in two independent legs. Storage: a Parquet IDatasetCodec that encodes typed dataset vintages as native Parquet for external compute handoff (Python/R workers read the blob directly) and decodes with schema verification against the declared DatasetSchema — compose via BlobDatasetStore.createWithCodec; the BCL JSON-frame codec remains the default. Ingestion: a ParquetDataSource IDataSource that reads third-party Parquet extracts through IBlobStorage, takes its schema from the file's own footer metadata (no inference) and streams row groups.",
